      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm studying for my diesel tech exam and I'm a bit stuck on the turbo part. Can you explain how a turbocharger actually works to increase the manifold pressure? Like, how does the exhaust gas turn into boost? thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
