      "content": "Okay, that makes more sense. I just want to make sure I get the sound part right for the troubleshooting section of the test. Sometimes when the turbo is working hard, you can hear this high-pitched whistling or whining sound. Is that just a normal part of the air being compressed or is it something else?",
